  "user_request_original": "Design a 24-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 dichroic stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence at normal angle. Initialize layer thicknesses from iteration_16 best candidate: [73.74, 173.68, 63.72, 117.85, 89.90, 91.13, 236.11, 73.97, 133.26, 90.19, 61.73, 87.94, 212.45, 89.67, 61.74, 83.26, 62.17, 89.15, 163.46, 214.22, 56.62, 87.41, 180.24, 56.30] nm. Apply thickness bounds: layers 11, 15, 19, 20 (0-indexed) have bounds centered at their initialization values with ±12% range; all other layers have bounds 50-280 nm. Use gradient-based thickness optimizer with annealing decay factor 0.98. Evaluate coherent TMM at normal incidence, unpolarized. Score objectives: maximize mean transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band, maximize mean reflectance in 400-700 nm band. Return best_target_score, valid_candidates, tightest_margin, thicknesses_nm, and run_status. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Total layer count <= 30.",
